  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Demon sweat**: back after 71 archived shows (721 days) [5]\n- **Pandy fickler**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [5]\n- **Goin gets tough from the getgo**: back after 70 archived shows (720 days); rare: 9 archived performances [5]\n- **Dancin' In the Show Tonight**: back after 108 archived shows (1370 days) [5]\n- **Superstar**: rare: 6 archived performances [5]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween2008-07-15.ca11** (recommended): source not stated; 38 songs; 182 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]\n- **ween2008-07-15**: source not stated; 38 songs; 183 min [2]\n- **ween2008-07-15.Flac16**: source not stated; 38 songs; 191 min [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween2008-07-15.ca11**: taped by Chris King; transferred by Chris King; source: Church-Audio STC-11> Church-Audio ST-9100 > M-audio2 (24/96) [1]. Also: Recorded with Church-Audio STC-11 microphones into a Church-Audio ST-9100, then an M-audio recorder at 24-bit/96kHz; Transferred from CF card using dbpoweramp, dithered to 16/44, then Cdwav, then FLAC [1]\n- **ween2008-07-15**: taped by Chris King; transferred by Chris King; source: CoreSound/Core In line Pre Amp M-audio1 (24/96) [2]. Also: Taped with CoreSound mics through a Core in-line preamp into an M-audio recorder at 24-bit/96kHz; Transferred from CF card via dbpoweramp, dithered to 16/44, then Cdwav, then FLAC [2]\n- **ween2008-07-15.Flac16**: taped by Eric Wilkens; source: MBHO 603 Cardioid ORTF 10' back 4' left of center 9' high clamped on post UA5 dmod-JB3 44.1 [3]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Fan art by admin: [Ween Played Hodi's Half Note On This Day In 2008 Full Audio](https://liveforlivemusic.com/news/ween-played-hodis-half-note-on-this-day-in-2008-full-audio/) [6]",
